+```
+{"data":{"id":13,"title":"検品テスト本","author":"検品著者","isbn":"9990000000001","published_date":"2020-01-01","description":null,"image_url":null,"average_rating":0,"reviews_count":0,"genres":[{"id":2,"name":"ビジネス"},{"id":5,"name":"エッセイ"}]}}
+HTTP 201
+```
